051400***************************************************************
051500**                                                           **
051600**   GET 'POPT' IN MPLTINFO TO SEE IF THE SELLER ADDRESS     **
051700**   NEEDS TO BE SWITCHED TO THE RIGHT SIDE OF THE FOLLOWUP  **
051800**   DOCUMENT.                                               **
051900**                                                           **
052000***************************************************************
052100
052200     MOVE "POPT"         TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
052700             MOVE "N"  TO  MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW
052800         ELSE
052900             MOVE "GET MPLTINFO 'POPT'*1H" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
053000             MOVE PLT-ARG  TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
053100             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
053200
053300******************************************************
053400**   IF MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW = 'Y' THEN THIS
053500**   MEANS SWITCH THE SELLER ADDRESS TO THE RIGHT
053600**   SIDE OF THE PURCHASE ORDER PRINT AND IF THERE
053700**   IS A DIFFERENT REMIT (PAYTO) VENDOR ADDRES THEN
053800**   PRINT IT ON THE LEFT.  IN OTHER WORDS THE ADDRESSES
053900**   ARE REVERSED.
054000******************************************************
054100
054200     IF MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW = "Y"
054300         MOVE "Y"                 TO SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW
054400     ELSE
054500         MOVE "N"                 TO SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW.
054600
