                   UNTIL SUB1 = 3
               IF YES-MZB
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               MOVE "MZB" TO PO-STD-INST (1)
               PERFORM 64-PRINT-STD-INST THRU 64-PSI-X.
