151900* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
152000* CHECK IF JCW INDICATES OKI (1) OR HP (0) PRINTERS.  *
152100* IF OKI, DON'T START A NEW PAGE.  OKI PRINTERS       *
152200* ARE SPOOLED THRU THE SYSTEM SPOOLER SO A PAGE IS    *
152300* AUTOMATICALLY ADVANCED BETWEEN PO PRINTOUTS.        *
152400* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
152500     MOVE SPACES                  TO  PRINT-LINE.
152600*    MOVE "NONHPPRT"              TO  JCW-NAME.
152700*    MOVE ZEROS                   TO  JCW-VALUE.
152800*    CALL INTRINSIC "FINDJCW" USING JCW-NAME, JCW-VALUE,
152900*        JCW-STATUS.
153000*    IF JCW-VALUE = 1
153100*-----------OKI DATA PRINTER (NONHP PRINTER)
153200*        NEXT SENTENCE
153300*    ELSE
153400*        WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING NEWPAGE.
